{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05356","headline":"奉和圣制送张说赴集贤院学士赐宴赋得虚字 · 徐坚","name":"奉和圣制送张说赴集贤院学士赐宴赋得虚字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"崇文德化洽，新殿集贤初。\n庸菲参高选，首滥承明庐。\n殊私光辅弼，荣送列簪裾。\n座引中厨馔，杯锡上尊余。\n翠叶浓丹苑，晴空卷碧虚。\n忝同文史地，愿草登封书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐坚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05356.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05356","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}